From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Skip missing legacy FOTA suggestion shortcut on AZH4

Reason: attempt25.txt:1230 reports that the fork's shortcut patch target
Settings$FOTASuggestionActivity.smali is absent from the AZH4 SecSettings APK.
The optional UN1CA Updates app and settings category are staged separately;
skip only this stale suggestion shortcut for the exact A376B Android 16 donor.
Files: unica/mods/choidujour/customize.sh.
Verification: donor-scoped branch fixture, shell syntax, full module preflight
and patch replay. Revert0057.

---
--- a/unica/mods/choidujour/customize.sh
+++ b/unica/mods/choidujour/customize.sh
@@ -21,8 +21,12 @@
 
 DECODE_APK "system" "system/priv-app/SecSettings/SecSettings.apk"
 
-APPLY_PATCH "system" "system/priv-app/SecSettings/SecSettings.apk" \
-    "$MODPATH/suggestions/SecSettings.apk/0001-Launch-UN1CA-Updates-from-suggestions.patch"
+if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ]; then
+    LOGW "A376B AZH4 has no legacy FOTA suggestion activity; skipping only the UN1CA Updates suggestion shortcut"
+else
+    APPLY_PATCH "system" "system/priv-app/SecSettings/SecSettings.apk" \
+        "$MODPATH/suggestions/SecSettings.apk/0001-Launch-UN1CA-Updates-from-suggestions.patch"
+fi
 
 # Disable stock OTA references
 SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/priv-app/SecSettings/SecSettings.apk" \
